   {
    "text": "**Performance Rubric for Clarissa**\n\n**1. Professional Attitude**  \n- Demonstrates a positive and professional demeanor.  \n- Shows respect and cooperation with colleagues.  \n- Maintains a consistent and reliable work ethic.  \n\n**2. Task Completion**  \n- Completes assigned tasks on time and to the required standard.  \n- Follows instructions and maintains quality in all work.  \n- Consistently meets or exceeds expectations.  \n\n**3. Communication**  \n- Communicates clearly and effectively with team members and supervisors.  \n- Responds to questions and feedback in a timely manner.  \n- Uses appropriate language and tone in all interactions.  \n\n**4. Initiative and Responsibility**  \n- Takes initiative to improve processes and contribute to team goals.  \n- Shows accountability for work and responsibilities.  \n- Demonstrates a proactive approach to problem-solving.  \n\n**5. Collaboration**  \n- Works well with others and supports team objectives.  \n- Shares ideas and contributes to group efforts.  \n- Maintains good relationships and fosters a positive work environment.  \n\n**6. Continuous Improvement**  \n- Shows a commitment to learning and growth.  \n- Applies feedback to enhance performance.  \n- Demonstrates a willingness to take on new challenges.  \n\n**7. Time Management**  \n- Prioritizes tasks effectively and meets deadlines.  \n- Manages time efficiently to ensure productivity.  \n- Adapts to changing priorities without compromising quality.  \n\n**8. Compliance and Standards**  \n- Adheres to company policies and procedures.  \n- Maintains high standards of professionalism and conduct.  \n- Demonstrates awareness of organizational goals and values.  \n\n**9. Feedback and Development**  \n- Receives and acts on feedback constructively.  \n- Shows a commitment to personal and professional development.  \n- Continuously seeks opportunities to improve.  \n\n**10. Overall Performance**  \n- Consistently delivers high-quality work that meets or exceeds expectations.  \n- Shows a strong work ethic and positive attitude.  \n- Is a valuable team member and contributes to the success of the team.  \n\n**Rating Scale:**  \n- **Exceeds Expectations (5)**: Outstanding performance with exceptional contributions.  \n- **Meets Expectations (4)**: Satisfactory performance with minor areas for improvement.  \n- **Meets Basic Expectations (3)**: Adequate performance with significant areas for development.  \n- **Does Not Meet Expectations (2)**: Needs improvement in multiple areas.  \n- **Fails to Meet Expectations",
